==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns as the boss after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ms. Sign]]s spawn after 600 seconds<sup>18,000f</sup>, delay 266.67 seconds<sup>8,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.07~1 seconds<sup>2f~30f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 10~14 seconds<sup>300f~420f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 10~14 seconds<sup>300f~420f</sup>.
**10 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Due to Camelle's very high range of 550, units that can outrange him, burst him down fast units or hitting him behind using Long Distance/Wave Attack. The Metal Hippoe and the peons can be taken advantage of by using Wave Attackers like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] and potentially kill him off before he does too much damage. When deploying rushers like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]], a well-timed Cat Cannon should be considered to wipe peons so they can get straight to Camelle.

