==Trivia==
*Chubby B. Goode is a pun on the song "Johnny B. Goode" by Chuck Berry.
*This is the first stage in [[Stories of Legend]] to feature [[Assassin Bear]].
*This is the first stage in [[Stories of Legend]] to consist of 9 different enemy units.

